"实现 SLE device发现和access的完整六阶段procedure:   a) "
"broadcaster准备并transmit可access扩展broadcast frame   b) "
"accessinitiatortransmitaccessrequestframe   c) "
"broadcasterreceiverequest并transmitresponse   d) "
"access方receiveresponse并进入connected state   e) datalink建立   f) "
"securityprocedure (委托给 security module)"

